							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3318.msg37419#msg37419"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3318.msg37419#msg37419">Re: Jena 6 Protests Recall the 50's, 60's</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> September 24, 2007, 02:34:38 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Write the Jena 6 directly!<br /><br /><br />Bill White, the leader of a neo-nazi organization based in Roanoke, VA called the National Socialist Movement (NSM) posted the Jena 6&#039;s addresses on his website, <a href="http&#58;//www.overthrow.com" target="_blank">www.overthrow.com</a> and called upon like-minded white people to kill them!<br />&nbsp;<br />A supporter of the anti-fascist One People&#039;s Project got their info from Bill&#039;s site and contacted the Jena 6 to let them know about the neo-nazi threat and to tell them that he supported their struggle. If you wish to do the same, and I encourage it, here is their contact info. Hey, artists: consider sending them a CD of your latest.&nbsp; <br />&nbsp;<br />Some of the Jena 6 Addresses:<br />Mychal Bell -- currently in prison -- son of Melissa Sue Bell -- 130 Bell Road; Jena, LA 71342.<br />&nbsp;<br />Robert Bailey, Jr -- son of Robert Bailey, Sr and Caseptla Bailey -- 1895 Berlin St; PO Box 1895; Jena, LA 71342<br />&nbsp;<br />Carwin Jones -- relation of Tina Jones -- 726 W Thorla St; Jena, LA 71342 318-992-1143 (ACTIVE)<br />&nbsp;<br />Bryant Purvis -- son of Tina Jones -- 726 W Thorla St; Jena, LA 71342 318-992-1143 (ACTIVE) Mr Purvis himself: (318) 992-4690 (ACTIVE)<br />&nbsp;<br />Theo Shaw -- 112 HC 60; BOX 112; JENA, LA 71342 (318) 267-0057 (ACTIVE)<br />&nbsp;<br />Jessie Ray Bard -- juvenile; address unknown but we&#039;re working on it.<br /></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext" width="85%">
